{
  "items": [
    {"id": "p5_001", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "0.45 里的“5”表示 5 个____。", "answer": "0.01", "kps": ["kp_p5_decimal_meaning"], "difficulty": 0.1, "solution": "0.45 的 5 在百分位，计数单位是 0.01，所以表示 5 个 0.01。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["p56-author-20260930", "p56-reverify-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_002", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "把 7.48 保留一位小数，结果是____。", "answer": "7.5", "kps": ["kp_p5_decimal_meaning"], "difficulty": 0.15, "solution": "保留一位小数看百分位，7.48 的百分位是 8，向前一位进 1，得 7.5。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_003", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "比较 0.58 和 0.6 的大小，下面说法正确的是（　）", "options": ["A. 0.58 > 0.6", "B. 0.58 = 0.6", "C. 0.58 < 0.6", "D. 无法比较"], "answer": "C", "kps": ["kp_p5_decimal_meaning"], "difficulty": 0.2, "solution": "比较小数大小先比十分位，0.58 的十分位是 5，0.6 的十分位是 6，5<6，所以 0.58<0.6。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_004", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "计算：2.35 + 4.67 = ____。", "answer": "7.02", "kps": ["kp_p5_decimal_add_sub"], "difficulty": 0.1, "solution": "小数点对齐后相加，百分位 5+7=12 写 2 进 1，十分位 3+6+1=10 写 0 进 1，个位 2+4+1=7，得 7.02。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_005", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "计算：10 - 3.28 = ____。", "answer": "6.72", "kps": ["kp_p5_decimal_add_sub"], "difficulty": 0.3, "misconceptions": ["mc_p5_dec_borrow"], "solution": "把 10 写成 10.00，小数点对齐连续退位相减，得 6.72。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_006", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "小马虎计算 7.2 + 1.56 时写出了 2.28，他出错的原因最有可能是（　）", "options": ["A. 忘记进位", "B. 没把小数点对齐，把 7.2 当成 0.72 来加了", "C. 把加法算成了减法", "D. 抄错了数字"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p5_decimal_add_sub"], "difficulty": 0.35, "misconceptions": ["mc_p5_dec_align"], "solution": "0.72 + 1.56 = 2.28，正是把 7.2 当成 0.72 末位对齐的结果，说明他没有把小数点对齐。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["p56-author-20260930", "p56-reverify-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_007", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "一块正方形手帕的边长是 0.9 分米，它的面积是____平方分米。", "answer": "0.81", "kps": ["kp_p5_decimal_mul"], "difficulty": 0.1, "solution": "正方形面积 = 边长×边长，0.9×0.9 = 0.81（平方分米）。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_008", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "每千克香蕉 4.8 元，买 2.3 千克香蕉需要____元（得数保留一位小数）。", "answer": "11.0", "kps": ["kp_p5_decimal_mul"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "4.8×2.3 = 11.04，保留一位小数看百分位 4，舍去得 11.0。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_009", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "不计算，下面算式中积的小数位数最多的是（　）", "options": ["A. 0.12×5", "B. 1.2×0.4", "C. 0.06×0.7", "D. 3.2×0.8"], "answer": "C", "kps": ["kp_p5_decimal_mul"], "difficulty": 0.45, "misconceptions": ["mc_p5_dec_point_mul", "mc_p5_dec_mul_shift"], "solution": "积的小数位数等于两个因数小数位数之和：A 是 2 位，B 是 2 位，C 是 3 位，D 是 2 位，所以选 C。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_010", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "把 12.5 千克糖果平均装在 5 个盒子里，每个盒子装____千克。", "answer": "2.5", "kps": ["kp_p5_decimal_div"], "difficulty": 0.15, "solution": "总质量除以盒子数：12.5÷5 = 2.5（千克）。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_011", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "一辆货车 0.36 小时行驶了 28.8 千米，这辆货车平均每小时行驶____千米。", "answer": "80", "kps": ["kp_p5_decimal_div"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "速度 = 路程÷时间：28.8÷0.36 = 2880÷36 = 80（千米/时）。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_012", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "下面关于小数除法的说法，正确的是（　）", "options": ["A. 计算 4.68÷1.2 时，要把被除数和除数同时扩大 100 倍", "B. 7.2÷0.36 转化后是 72÷36", "C. 9.8÷0.7 的商是 14", "D. 商一定比被除数小"], "answer": "C", "kps": ["kp_p5_decimal_div"], "difficulty": 0.4, "solution": "A 错：除数 1.2 是一位小数，应同时扩大 10 倍；B 错：0.36 是两位小数，应得 720÷36；C 对：9.8÷0.7 = 14；D 错：如 4.8÷0.5 = 9.6，比被除数大。", "source": "original", "verification": {"agents": ["p56-author-20260930", "p56-reverify-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_013", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "计算：（4.2 + 5.8）×（1.2 - 0.2） = ____", "answer": "10", "kps": ["kp_p5_mixed_ops"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "先算两个括号：4.2+5.8=10，1.2-0.2=1，再相乘 10×1=10。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_014", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "计算 3.5×2.8 + 1.2×3.5 时，正确的运算顺序是（　）", "options": ["A. 先算乘法，再算加法", "B. 先算加法，再算乘法", "C. 从左到右依次计算", "D. 先算 2.8+1.2"], "answer": "A", "kps": ["kp_p5_mixed_ops"], "difficulty": 0.2, "solution": "算式中有乘法和加法且没有括号，按四则运算顺序要先算乘法，再算加法。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_015", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "简算：0.125 × 32 × 2.5 = ____", "answer": "10", "kps": ["kp_p5_mixed_ops"], "difficulty": 0.4, "solution": "把 32 拆成 8×4：0.125×8=1，2.5×4=10，所以结果是 10。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_016", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "在 8、12、15、19、22、25 这些数中，是 3 的倍数的最小的数是____。", "answer": "12", "kps": ["kp_p5_factor_multiple"], "difficulty": 0.1, "solution": "3 的倍数各位数字之和是 3 的倍数：12（1+2=3）和 15（1+5=6）符合，最小是 12。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_017", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "下面关于质数和合数的说法，正确的是（　）", "options": ["A. 1 是质数", "B. 2 是合数", "C. 4 是合数", "D. 9 是质数"], "answer": "C", "kps": ["kp_p5_factor_multiple"], "difficulty": 0.2, "misconceptions": ["mc_p5_prime_one", "mc_p5_odd_prime"], "solution": "1 既不是质数也不是合数；2 是质数；4=2×2 是合数；9=3×3 是合数不是质数。所以选 C。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_018", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "下面关于数的奇偶性和质数合数的说法，正确的是（　）", "options": ["A. 两个质数的和一定是偶数", "B. 两个奇数的和一定是偶数", "C. 所有的合数都是偶数", "D. 1 既不是质数也不是合数，所以 1 不是自然数"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p5_factor_multiple"], "difficulty": 0.5, "solution": "2+3=5 是奇数，A 错；奇数+奇数=偶数，B 对；9 是奇数也是合数，C 错；1 是自然数，D 错。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_019", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "下面各数中，是 12 的因数的是（　）", "options": ["A. 5", "B. 6", "C. 7", "D. 8"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p5_factor_multiple"], "difficulty": 0.1, "solution": "12÷6=2 没有余数，所以 6 是 12 的因数；5、7、8 除 12 都有余数。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_020", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "下面哪组数中，第一个数是第二个数的倍数？（　）", "options": ["A. 12 和 4", "B. 4 和 12", "C. 12 和 5", "D. 5 和 12"], "answer": "A", "kps": ["kp_p5_factor_multiple"], "difficulty": 0.35, "solution": "12÷4=3 没有余数，所以 12 是 4 的倍数；其余各组都不能整除。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_021", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "5/8 的分数单位是____。", "answer": "1/8", "kps": ["kp_p5_fraction_meaning"], "difficulty": 0.1, "solution": "把单位“1”平均分成 8 份，表示其中 1 份的数是 1/8，这就是 5/8 的分数单位。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_022", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "把 3 米长的绳子平均分成 4 段，每段长____米。", "answer": "3/4", "kps": ["kp_p5_fraction_meaning"], "difficulty": 0.15, "solution": "求每段长度用总长除以段数：3÷4 = 3/4（米）。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_023", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "下面分数中，与 3/4 相等的是（　）", "options": ["A. 6/10", "B. 9/12", "C. 12/18", "D. 15/24"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p5_fraction_meaning"], "difficulty": 0.2, "solution": "分数基本性质：3/4 的分子分母同时乘 3 得 9/12；6/10=3/5，12/18=2/3，15/24=5/8，都不等于 3/4。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_024", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "计算 1/3 + 1/6，结果正确的是（　）", "options": ["A. 1/2", "B. 1/3", "C. 2/9", "D. 1/4"], "answer": "A", "kps": ["kp_p5_fraction_add_sub"], "difficulty": 0.25, "misconceptions": ["mc_p5_frac_add"], "solution": "先通分：1/3 = 2/6，2/6+1/6 = 3/6 = 1/2。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_025", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "计算 3/4 - 1/3，结果正确的是（　）", "options": ["A. 5/12", "B. 7/12", "C. 1/2", "D. 2/1"], "answer": "A", "kps": ["kp_p5_fraction_add_sub"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "先通分：3/4 = 9/12，1/3 = 4/12，9/12-4/12 = 5/12。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_026", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "计算：1/2 + 1/4 - 1/8 = ____", "answer": "5/8", "kps": ["kp_p5_fraction_add_sub"], "difficulty": 0.35, "solution": "通分到 8 作分母：4/8 + 2/8 - 1/8 = 5/8。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_027", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "一个平行四边形的底是 12 厘米，高是 8 厘米，它的面积是____平方厘米。", "answer": "96", "kps": ["kp_p5_polygon_area"], "difficulty": 0.2, "solution": "平行四边形面积 = 底×高：12×8 = 96（平方厘米）。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_028", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "一个三角形的底是 10 厘米，高是 6 厘米，它的面积是（　）", "options": ["A. 60平方厘米", "B. 30平方厘米", "C. 15平方厘米", "D. 20平方厘米"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p5_polygon_area"], "difficulty": 0.3, "misconceptions": ["mc_p5_area_half"], "solution": "三角形面积 = 底×高÷2：10×6÷2 = 30（平方厘米）；A 是忘除以 2 的结果。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_029", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "一个梯形的上底是 7 厘米，下底是 11 厘米，高是 5 厘米，它的面积是____平方厘米。", "answer": "45", "kps": ["kp_p5_polygon_area"], "difficulty": 0.4, "misconceptions": ["mc_p5_area_mix"], "solution": "梯形面积 = (上底+下底)×高÷2：(7+11)×5÷2 = 45（平方厘米）。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_030", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "一个长方体的长是 5 厘米，宽是 4 厘米，高是 3 厘米，它的体积是____立方厘米。", "answer": "60", "kps": ["kp_p5_cuboid_volume"], "difficulty": 0.2, "solution": "长方体体积 = 长×宽×高：5×4×3 = 60（立方厘米）。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_031", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "一个正方体的棱长是 2 厘米，它的表面积是（　）", "options": ["A. 8平方厘米", "B. 24平方厘米", "C. 16平方厘米", "D. 32平方厘米"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p5_cuboid_volume"], "difficulty": 0.3, "misconceptions": ["mc_p5_area_half"], "solution": "正方体表面积 = 棱长×棱长×6：2×2×6 = 24（平方厘米）；A 是它的体积，属于混淆项。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_032", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "2.5 立方分米 = ____ 立方厘米。", "answer": "2500", "kps": ["kp_p5_cuboid_volume"], "difficulty": 0.4, "solution": "1 立方分米 = 1000 立方厘米，2.5×1000 = 2500。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_033", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "在方格纸上，某个点位于第 2 列第 5 行，用数对表示该点的位置是____。", "answer": "(2,5)", "kps": ["kp_p5_coord_pairs"], "difficulty": 0.2, "solution": "数对先写列数再写行数，第 2 列第 5 行的数对是 (2,5)。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_034", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "数对 (3,5) 和 (5,3) 表示的两个位置，关系是（　）", "options": ["A. 是同一个位置", "B. 在同一列", "C. 在同一行", "D. 既不在同一列也不在同一行"], "answer": "D", "kps": ["kp_p5_coord_pairs"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "(3,5) 是第 3 列第 5 行，(5,3) 是第 5 列第 3 行，列数和行数都不同。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_035", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "在方格纸上，所有位于第 4 列的点，用数对表示时第一个数都是____。", "answer": "4", "kps": ["kp_p5_coord_pairs"], "difficulty": 0.4, "solution": "数对的第一个数表示列数，同一列的点第一个数相同，都是 4。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_036", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "一个点的位置用数对表示是 (2,3)，将它向右平移 4 格后，位置用数对表示是____。", "answer": "(6,3)", "kps": ["kp_p5_graph_motion"], "difficulty": 0.2, "solution": "向右平移列数增加、行数不变：2+4=6，行仍是 3，所以是 (6,3)。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_037", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "钟面上的指针原本指向“12”（正北方向），绕中心顺时针旋转 90° 后指向（　）", "options": ["A. 北", "B. 东", "C. 南", "D. 西"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p5_graph_motion"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "顺时针是钟表指针转动的方向，正北顺时针转 90° 指向正东。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_038", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "下面图形中，是轴对称图形的是（　）", "options": ["A. 普通平行四边形", "B. 等腰三角形", "C. 直角梯形", "D. 不等边三角形"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p5_graph_motion"], "difficulty": 0.4, "solution": "等腰三角形沿底边上的高对折后两侧完全重合，是轴对称图形；其余三个都不是。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_039", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "折线统计图最适合表示（　）", "options": ["A. 各类食物数量的多少", "B. 气温随时间的变化趋势", "C. 学生最喜欢的体育项目", "D. 各班人数的对比"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p5_line_graph"], "difficulty": 0.2, "solution": "折线统计图能清楚地反映数据的增减变化趋势，适合表示气温随时间的变化。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_040", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "某地一周中，周一气温是 12℃，周日气温是 28℃，周日比周一气温高____℃。", "answer": "16", "kps": ["kp_p5_line_graph"], "difficulty": 0.1, "solution": "读出两天的数据后相减：28-12 = 16（℃）。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_041", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "折线统计图上某日气温记录如下：8时 20℃，10时 26℃，12时 30℃，14时 35℃。气温上升最快的时间段是（　）", "options": ["A. 8时到10时", "B. 10时到12时", "C. 12时到14时", "D. 无法确定"], "answer": "A", "kps": ["kp_p5_line_graph"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "各段时间间隔相同（2 小时），比较上升幅度：8-10 时升 6℃，10-12 时升 4℃，12-14 时升 5℃，最快是 8 时到 10 时。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_042", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "盒子里放了 5 个红球、2 个黄球和 1 个蓝球，除颜色外完全相同，从中摸出一个球，摸到（　）的可能性最大。", "options": ["A. 红球", "B. 黄球", "C. 蓝球", "D. 三种球一样大"], "answer": "A", "kps": ["kp_p5_possibility"], "difficulty": 0.2, "solution": "数量越多摸到的可能性越大，红球有 5 个最多，所以摸到红球的可能性最大。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_043", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "一个转盘被平均分成红、黄、蓝 3 个区域，转动转盘，指针停下的颜色可能有____种结果。", "answer": "3", "kps": ["kp_p5_possibility"], "difficulty": 0.1, "solution": "转盘上有红、黄、蓝 3 种颜色区域，指针停下可能停在其中任何一种上，共 3 种结果。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_044", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "下面说法正确的是（　）", "options": ["A. 明天一定下雨", "B. 太阳一定从东边升起", "C. 小明的身高一定能超过 3 米", "D. 抛一枚硬币，落地后一定是正面朝下"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p5_possibility"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "太阳从东边升起是必然事件；明天是否下雨、身高能否超过 3 米、硬币哪面朝上都是不确定的，不能说“一定”。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_045", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "一本练习本的单价是 a 元，买 6 本这样的练习本需要____元。", "answer": "6a", "kps": ["kp_p5_letter_number"], "difficulty": 0.2, "solution": "总价 = 单价×数量：a×6 = 6a（元）。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_046", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "当 x = 4 时，式子 3x + 2 的值是____。", "answer": "14", "kps": ["kp_p5_letter_number"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "把 x=4 代入：3×4+2 = 14。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_047", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "下列关于含字母式子的简写，正确的是（　）", "options": ["A. a×a 简写成 a2", "B. a+a 简写成 2a", "C. a×2 简写成 a2", "D. a+a 简写成 a²"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p5_letter_number"], "difficulty": 0.4, "solution": "a+a 表示两个 a 相加，简写成 2a；a×a 才能写成 a²，a×2 写成 2a。所以选 B。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_048", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "一条路长 100 米，每隔 5 米栽一棵树（两端都栽），一共要栽____棵树。", "answer": "21", "kps": ["kp_p5_tree_planting"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "间隔数：100÷5 = 20 个；两端都栽时棵数 = 间隔数+1，即 21 棵。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_049", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "一条路长 60 米，每隔 4 米栽一棵树（只有一端栽，另一端不栽），一共要栽____棵树。", "answer": "15", "kps": ["kp_p5_tree_planting"], "difficulty": 0.2, "solution": "间隔数：60÷4 = 15 个；一端栽时棵数等于间隔数，栽 15 棵。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p5_050", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "一个圆形池塘的周长是 30 米，沿池塘边每隔 3 米栽一棵树，一共要栽（　）棵树。", "options": ["A. 9", "B. 10", "C. 11", "D. 12"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p5_tree_planting"], "difficulty": 0.4, "solution": "封闭图形上栽树，棵数 = 间隔数：30÷3 = 10（棵）。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["step-3.7-flash", "p5-reviewer-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}}
